: "005.png", "id": "1039875214854716", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393516_1039875218188049_231288402583328065_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cLrgngR5EjgQ7kNvwEOJKLi&_nc_oc=Ado2rfWskvbrnfT_XZdq4Bv43zgh3hIj0Jozs6Q1Xz0kxTDib_fCs5cjXMbX78mkXu0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9v2P5VsGS_D_qOUhsXVY8okT2_dfUFrNIQQHA7szOUrA&oe=6A356F27"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "005.png", "id": "517509354762187", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391952_517509358095520_2919512691968294005_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AeY5W2VL0zcQ7kNvwF5mAd-&_nc_oc=AdonTGK16eDcibv8IbPgot1skMg3w9CE5uGlX4IrD-V7RzymoevpMXOb_COqG2dJMKw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_wLqg3Jq5Cr1AdB9m1IQaoOh-o57lxgLLz2ql5d9EzmA&oe=6A355209"}, "display_name": "Legends BMX", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Legends BMX VR** brings BMX action to Mixed Reality on Meta Quest. Overlay 3D bikeparks onto your real-world environment using passthrough and ride freely within your space.\n\n- Resize the track to fit your room.  \n- Link up insane tricks and climb the global rankings.  \n- Join weekly challenges and compete on *online leaderboards*.\n\n**Actively developed, but already solid and fun**  \nWhile we're actively improving and expanding the game, this VR version already offers a complete and stable experience. *Legends BMX* is also being developed for PC and consoles, where it's being very well received.\n\nJump into the park and help us fine-tune the final experience.  \nThanks for being part of the journey \u2014 see you in the park!\n", "short_description": "Pure flow and adrenaline \u2014 now in Mixed Reality!\nRide your BMX through dynamic parks superimposed on your real-world space. Pull off insane tricks, chase high scores, and feel the thrill of BMX in a whole new way."}]}, "developer_name": null, "develope